    "The $x$ and $y$ coordinates are used as the clustering features. The resulting cluster\n",
    "centroids represent the proposed locations of the three drone depots.\n",
    "\n",
    "The number of depots is stored in the `N_DEPOTS` variable so that it can easily be\n",
    "changed later when different depot counts are investigated."
