   "source": [
    "#### 4.2.5 Recommendations Based on Popular Products\n",
    "\n",
    "The most frequently occurring product groups and itemsets are identified using support.\n",
    "\n",
    "Products with high support occur frequently in the transaction data and are therefore important products for inventory planning.\n",
    "\n",
    "The company should use these results to ensure that frequently purchased product groups are sufficiently available. High support alone does not prove that one product causes another purchase, so these results are used primarily for demand and inventory planning rather than as evidence of a causal relationship."
   ]
  },
