   "source": [
    "#### 4.2.6 Recommendations Based on Association Rule Confidence\n",
    "\n",
    "High-confidence association rules can be used to create product recommendation features.\n",
    "\n",
    "When a customer purchases or selects the products in the antecedent of a rule, the company can recommend the products in the consequent as \"Customers who bought this also bought...\" products.\n",
    "\n",
    "The rules should not be used based on confidence alone. Support should also be considered to avoid focusing on extremely rare combinations."
   ]
  },
